@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFE9A9
skinparam defaultFontName Nunito
title Entry in the waiting list
state "Saving" as SavingState
[*] --> Ready : file chosen, pasted, link loaded
Ready --> SavingState : Save
SavingState --> Duplicate : 409 duplicate
SavingState --> Error : other error
SavingState --> [*] : 201 stored, entry removed
Error --> SavingState : Save again
Ready --> [*] : Remove entry
Duplicate --> [*] : Remove entry
Error --> [*] : Remove entry
note right of Duplicate : skipped when saving
@enduml
